{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名の通り私は人生一番短い髪型になったんじゃないかな？と思うし、今は乃木坂で一番髪の毛短いです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪切る前はアレンジとかしたいし女の子っぽいっていうのはやっぱりボブとかの方が女の子らしくていいかな？と思ってて\nでも少しだけ髪切ろうかなぁと思ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなんにしよーってとっても優柔不断なので迷って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型ってとっても大事じゃない⁉雰囲気とか一気に変わるし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから友達に「どんなんにしよー」って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ショート！！！\n短く切ってきて！できるだけ短く！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の一点張りで、そんな勇気ないけど\nなんかわかんない、やってみようかなぁ‥\nいやでも怖いなぁ。っと思ったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその友達の言うことはなんか絶対大丈夫かもっていう気がしてきて‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず切ってみようと思い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バッサリ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはパシフィコ横浜アルバム個握の時の写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めまして、やっと会えましたって方 ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい女の子もたくさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして いつも来てくださる方！ありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れないけどコメントとかで応援してくれた方！\n本当に本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達と一緒に来てくれた方もありがとう！o(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スッゴク楽しい時間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/07/11/4613190/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"br